{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"636012145204527127","content":"I'm not normally one for sappy thank yous like this. I'll usually think about one bit never write it I or send it. But here goes...\n\nI'd like to that all of you, collectively and individually. From the edgiest edges of the edge club  to the sweet and wholesome. From the DMs to the players. From the constant survivors to the casual dippers. I had quite a rough night last night, and choose not to go into detail at this time as it distracts further from my point. As I was saying, I had a rough night and while we may have fought and lost with a kraken, we also finally made it to Roanoke. During this time, y'all helped me stave off a breakdown at work. With all the wonderful flavor, and joy, along with the intense battle, to even the incredible rp. (Except you Web, you're great and all but feck you. You know what you did.) But all of it, the good and the bad made my night much better than if if I hadn't known yall. So thank you all again. I love you all. \n\nGod it's so sappy. Low key feel bad, but Team Roanoke is worth it. You chaos bunch of wholesome jerks are the greatest group I've played with. \n\nOkay. I'm seriously stopping now before I make myself sick from all this sap.","created_at":"2020-08-01T11:03:16.991000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739075778636939264","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
